WEBVTT

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:37.040
At this rate, you'll destroy all the frogs in the entire county, my dear.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.020
I asked you before not to come down to my laboratory while I'm busy with my experiment.

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:48.270
If these animals could speak, they'd have something to say about your taste.

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.920
This always happens when you permit yourself to overindulge in your brandy.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:55.660
You are trying to provoke me, but this is not the moment, dear.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:59.970
You're leaving for the Edinburgh Congress with a lot of fanatical good...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.380
