00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.550
Well, Sonage, so you saw everything.

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.810
You even enjoyed it, I presume, didn't you?

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:36.260
I am too old for that sort of thing, Baroness.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:40.950
