00:55:43.690 --> 00:55:47.990
Excuse me, madame. Dr. Stephen would like to show Dr. Joyce some of your jewellery.

00:55:48.460 --> 00:55:51.550
If you would like to go down yourself, they will be very pleased.

00:55:52.050 --> 00:55:53.800
