The earring is one of those in the portrait,

00:56:21.290 --> 00:56:22.470
so there's no doubt about it.

00:56:22.650 --> 00:56:24.670
It's true, then, that they belong to Muriel.

00:56:25.330 --> 00:56:25.730
Undoubtedly.

