Consider the numerous cases of telepathy, of clairvoyance, and even of diagnosis from a distance.

00:57:51.110 --> 00:57:57.320
There is no doubt that the witches and wizards of Africa and Siberia do no more than make use of their brains.

00:57:57.530 --> 00:57:59.960
In a way, I should say, that is more intelligent...

