than ours we know that they are able to enter directly into contact with the beyond and even

00:58:06.250 --> 00:58:15.510
with the dead well let us not exaggerate telepathy is one thing the beyond is quite another i must ask

00:58:15.510 --> 00:58:23.740
you to excuse me i think i'll go upstairs i feel a little tired what is it jenny is something wrong

00:58:23.890 --> 00:58:29.720
no nothing i just just feel a little tired and don't trouble yourself

00:58:30.730 --> 00:58:33.380
I'll join you immediately. Good night.

00:58:34.760 --> 00:58:35.400
Good night, Jenny.

00:58:36.160 --> 00:58:36.860
Good night, madame.

00:58:45.920 --> 00:58:46.480
Poor Jenny.

00:58:48.310 --> 00:58:50.230
