01:08:24.950 --> 01:08:27.070
But his being here makes things so dangerous.

01:08:28.380 --> 01:08:29.880
Why did he go down into the crypt?

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:40.680
last night. Maybe he found out something. He found out enough to hang us both. He moved the slab on

01:08:40.680 --> 01:08:48.960
Muriel's tomb and discovered it was empty. So then we are ruined. He could turn us over at any moment

01:08:48.960 --> 01:08:57.720
now. You must stop him from leaving the castle at all costs. We must... Keep quiet. I know what we

01:08:57.720 --> 01:08:58.160
