01:09:04.670 --> 01:09:06.030
You were looking for me, doctor?

01:09:06.150 --> 01:09:07.030
Why, yes, I was.

01:09:07.250 --> 01:09:09.870
I wanted to have a few words with you before you went to the laboratory.

01:09:10.190 --> 01:09:11.590
Nothing would please me more.

01:09:11.710 --> 01:09:12.010
Thank you.

01:09:19.260 --> 01:09:20.060
Won't you sit down?

01:09:20.620 --> 01:09:20.980
Thank you.

01:09:27.090 --> 01:09:28.890
I wanted to speak to you about your wife.

01:09:30.670 --> 01:09:34.090
I'm convinced that it is absolutely necessary for her to leave the castle,

01:09:34.310 --> 01:09:36.830
