01:09:51.730 --> 01:09:53.290
Souls living in another world,

01:09:53.930 --> 01:09:55.790
trying to hide themselves behind Jenny,

01:09:56.450 --> 01:09:57.470
trying to possess her,

01:09:58.550 --> 01:09:59.970
to destroy her mind and...

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:15.680
Free will. Your wife is not mad, but she runs the risk of becoming so if she continues to live here in this castle.

01:10:17.100 --> 01:10:27.300
I quite realize that. It was I who asked you to come here, and I shall abide by any decision you feel it necessary to make.

01:10:27.710 --> 01:10:29.270
I have already mentioned it to Jenny.

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:30.780
I'm sure she will agree.

01:10:31.120 --> 01:10:31.780
All the better.

01:10:32.820 --> 01:10:35.020
Will you be taking her back to the same clinic

01:10:35.020 --> 01:10:36.280
