01:10:36.600 --> 01:10:38.160
Definitely, yes, to begin with.

01:10:38.820 --> 01:10:40.720
I plan to take her away with me tomorrow.

01:10:42.630 --> 01:10:44.640
Well, I'll leave you to your work.

01:10:45.500 --> 01:10:46.240
Thank you, Doctor.

01:11:34.960 --> 01:11:35.160
No.

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:03.550
I'm sure it will work. Wouldn't poison have been a safer way?

01:13:04.040 --> 01:13:06.660
There isn't a poison which leaves no traces.

01:13:07.780 --> 01:13:10.820
In this way, we don't run any risks and the result is the same.

01:13:22.450 --> 01:13:22.830
Come in.

01:13:28.600 --> 01:13:29.360
Would you call, sir?

01:13:29.780 --> 01:13:29.960
Yes.

01:13:30.060 --> 01:13:32.660
I think it's about time for my evening bath.

01:13:32.800 --> 01:13:34.360
It will be ready in just a moment, sir.

01:13:34.540 --> 01:13:35.100
Thank you, Jonathan.

01:14:00.570 --> 01:14:17.580
Ready Jonathan already, sir. Will you be needing anything else? No

01:14:55.250 --> 01:14:57.290
Excuse me, sir. I forgot about the clean towel.

01:14:57.430 --> 01:14:58.070
Oh, that's all right.

01:15:32.480 --> 01:15:39.950
Jonathan! Jonathan! Jonathan, what happened?

01:15:40.710 --> 01:15:43.510
Jonathan! What happened, Jonathan?

01:15:45.560 --> 01:15:47.260
There's no doubt he had a heart attack.

01:15:48.950 --> 01:15:52.200
Probably he suffered from a weak heart without knowing it.

01:15:53.060 --> 01:15:53.780
Quite possibly.

01:15:54.490 --> 01:15:57.050
Also, the overheated atmosphere of the room

01:15:57.050 --> 01:15:58.890
could easily have had some influence.

01:16:03.160 --> 01:16:05.400
Please, Jenny, go back to your room.

01:16:06.350 --> 01:16:08.270
Solange, go with her ladyship.

01:16:12.390 --> 01:16:16.850
This one is certainly a case that makes one think very seriously

01:16:16.850 --> 01:16:18.890
about the frailty of human life.

01:16:20.400 --> 01:16:23.640
Only ten minutes ago, that man was the picture of health,

01:16:23.970 --> 01:16:26.130
and now he is ready for the worm.

01:16:26.840 --> 01:16:29.920
Please allow me not to appreciate your cynicism, Dr. Aras.

01:16:30.860 --> 01:16:32.520
Forgive me, my dear Derrick.

01:16:33.060 --> 01:16:37.060
The fact is, you have remained too much a man to be a scientist.

01:16:37.820 --> 01:16:39.060
Oh, and before I forget,

01:16:39.460 --> 01:16:42.680
will you think about making out a death certificate for the authorities?

01:16:42.700 --> 01:16:42.960
Right away.

01:16:43.220 --> 01:16:45.660
Something else, if you don't mind.

01:16:45.660 --> 01:16:49.940
Will you help me to carry poor Jonathan's body into his room?

01:17:01.310 --> 01:17:03.430
Is there anything else I can get you, madame?

01:17:04.630 --> 01:17:09.220
No. All I want to do is leave this house before it's too late.

01:17:19.000 --> 01:17:21.660
There. Forgive me, doctor.

01:17:23.230 --> 01:17:26.490
I'm afraid I've asked you to perform a rather unpleasant task.

01:17:27.960 --> 01:17:28.980
We can go now.

01:17:29.560 --> 01:17:29.960
It will...

01:17:30.000 --> 01:17:34.300
He'll probably seem very silly to you, but I would like to leave a little light for him.

01:17:35.060 --> 01:17:37.620
Go ahead. I'll see you later.

01:18:00.220 --> 01:18:01.380
And now what shall we do?

01:18:01.790 --> 01:18:04.320
Your wife says she wants to go away, at once.

01:18:05.000 --> 01:18:07.000
On the contrary, she won't go anywhere.

01:18:07.460 --> 01:18:08.820
Of that I can assure you,

01:18:08.980 --> 01:18:11.760
everything will turn out exactly as we want it.

01:18:13.230 --> 01:18:14.210
Go along now, let's see.

01:18:32.840 --> 01:18:34.790
You look a little distraught, Jenny.

01:18:36.470 --> 01:18:39.850
I realize that what happened to Jonathan was a painful shock to you,

01:18:39.970 --> 01:18:41.290
but you mustn't be disheartened.

01:18:43.970 --> 01:18:46.030
Stephen, I can't stand it.

01:18:48.000 --> 01:18:49.660
I don't want to stay here anymore.

01:18:53.460 --> 01:18:56.860
I'm leaving tomorrow with Derek, for wherever he chooses to take me.

01:18:57.820 --> 01:18:59.460
Anything will be better than this hell.

01:19:01.210 --> 01:19:04.620
With Derek, I thought so.

01:19:06.440 --> 01:19:07.940
He's bewitched you with his stories.

01:19:09.860 --> 01:19:10.680
What are you saying?

01:19:11.500 --> 01:19:12.800
Why are you talking like that?

01:19:13.620 --> 01:19:15.260
You had so much faith in him now.

01:19:15.620 --> 01:19:20.610
Now, I see that his so-called treating you

01:19:20.610 --> 01:19:23.670
was just an excuse to flirt shamelessly with you

01:19:23.670 --> 01:19:25.610
and don't say you didn't realize it yourself.

01:19:26.310 --> 01:19:29.270
But I swear to you, I've known Derek for years.

01:19:30.320 --> 01:19:36.120
Such a good friend of mine, so affectionate and unselfish.

01:19:36.120 --> 01:19:38.560
You may be blind, my dear, but I'm not.

01:19:40.040 --> 01:19:44.060
I know his type, affectionate, unselfish,

01:19:45.300 --> 01:19:49.100
and always ready to take advantage of a beautiful patient.

01:19:52.880 --> 01:19:55.250
No, don't you dare say that.

01:19:55.760 --> 01:19:57.040
Derek hasn't done anything wrong.

01:19:58.260 --> 01:19:58.740
Uh...

01:20:00.090 --> 01:20:06.850
Caresses, holding hands, and soft looks, all part of the cure.

01:20:09.320 --> 01:20:12.420
You forget that greenhouses are made of glass, and I am not blind.

01:20:20.200 --> 01:20:20.940
I love you, Jenny.

01:20:22.520 --> 01:20:23.860
I don't want to lose you.

01:20:25.290 --> 01:20:28.130
I can't stand the idea of your going away with him.

01:20:30.600 --> 01:20:32.080
Don't leave me alone, Jenny.

01:20:37.970 --> 01:20:39.370
I don't want to, Stephen.

01:20:43.310 --> 01:20:44.690
I'm so frightened here.

01:20:46.310 --> 01:20:48.170
We'll go away together tomorrow.

01:20:50.360 --> 01:20:53.300
We'll go to Spain, to Italy, wherever you want.

01:20:54.100 --> 01:20:56.600
You'll leave all your nightmares behind you.

01:20:57.260 --> 01:20:59.980
And we won't come back here until you have complete...

01:21:00.730 --> 01:21:05.460
All right, then we leave tomorrow.

01:21:08.440 --> 01:21:09.960
Just as you say, Stephen.

01:21:53.100 --> 01:21:56.110
Certainly, this journey can do you nothing but good.

01:21:56.960 --> 01:21:59.740
You'll be able to amuse yourself, to breathe purer air.

01:22:00.640 --> 01:22:02.080
To find real tranquility.

01:22:03.810 --> 01:22:06.510
I cannot pretend that I shouldn't have preferred another solution.

01:22:07.070 --> 01:22:08.610
Do you mean the asylum, Dr. Derrick?

01:22:09.350 --> 01:22:10.310
Or have you other plans?

01:22:11.480 --> 01:22:14.140
But Jenny, why are you saying these things?

01:22:20.040 --> 01:22:22.700
It seems as if you had suddenly lost all faith in me.

01:22:25.460 --> 01:22:27.720
Perhaps you see me as some clinical case

01:22:27.720 --> 01:22:29.820
to be kept under observation and studied.

01:22:30.960 --> 01:22:34.360
It would be bad enough if that's true, yet, in a way, I wish it was so.

01:22:35.880 --> 01:22:39.970
Because if what happened last night has put any ideas in your head,

01:22:40.530 --> 01:22:45.540
I'll be obliged to consider you simply one of the most contemptible of men.

01:22:57.660 --> 01:22:59.180
Realize that after what you have said,

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:01.120
There's nothing I can answer.

01:23:02.200 --> 01:23:04.740
Whatever I might say would only confirm your suspicions.

01:23:05.550 --> 01:23:08.150
Now, the only thing left for me to do is to go away.

01:23:08.790 --> 01:23:11.340
But before I go, I want to tell you this, Jenny.

01:23:13.380 --> 01:23:15.300
I have always been very fond of you.

01:23:16.640 --> 01:23:19.320
And any time you need me, I shall be happy to help you.

01:23:35.630 --> 01:23:39.420
It's so cold tonight, that damn blood.

01:23:40.330 --> 01:23:46.960
It's turning to poison in my veins, cold, heavy, like mercury.

01:23:48.430 --> 01:23:53.810
She wants it back. Muriel, that witch, she wants her blood.

01:23:54.920 --> 01:23:59.980
Steven, do something, save me. I need new life.

01:24:02.620 --> 01:24:08.920
Yeah, pure blood. I need Jenny's blood.

01:24:10.450 --> 01:24:13.670
Very well, then. You'll get it tomorrow.

01:25:44.720 --> 01:25:56.430
Who are you? Muriel? Where is your body?

01:26:10.560 --> 01:26:11.500
Who killed you, Steven?

01:27:08.320 --> 01:27:08.560
You

01:28:32.650 --> 01:28:32.810
Amen.

01:29:14.110 --> 01:29:15.150
Well, have a good journey.

01:29:15.560 --> 01:29:17.920
Thank you again for everything you've done for my wife.

01:29:18.160 --> 01:29:19.640
There is nothing to thank me for.

01:29:20.330 --> 01:29:22.810
And would you please say goodbye to her for me?

01:29:22.930 --> 01:29:25.440
Goodbye, Derek. I'm grateful to you for trying to help me.

01:29:25.870 --> 01:29:29.960
Oh, I'm delighted to be able to wish you a pleasant...

01:29:30.090 --> 01:29:41.020
Once more and I hope to see you again very soon. Why are you going? Don't you find enough to interest you here?

01:29:47.560 --> 01:29:55.340
Do you like the Hampton Crest? Bye and good luck

01:30:10.170 --> 01:30:13.020
When? Now. Stephen, I beg you.

01:30:13.510 --> 01:30:16.270
We must be far from here before he is able to speak to anybody.

01:30:16.530 --> 01:30:18.270
I am preparing the electrolysis.

01:30:18.570 --> 01:30:20.490
You know that it's only a matter of a few hours.

01:30:21.200 --> 01:30:23.580
Everything will be ready for you by this evening.

01:30:25.090 --> 01:30:27.730
Then we'll leave during the night, all three of us.

01:30:28.750 --> 01:30:29.590
At least officially.

01:30:31.440 --> 01:30:32.720
I'm going down to the laboratory.

01:31:25.080 --> 01:31:25.920
But even I wonder if...

01:31:31.080 --> 01:31:41.280
Come along. There's no time to lose.

01:32:20.732 --> 01:32:24.732
I'm going to free you from your nightmares forever, Jenny.

01:32:26.108 --> 01:32:28.228
sister is calling you, isn't she?

01:32:28.860 --> 01:32:29.980
Can't you hear her?

01:32:30.790 --> 01:32:34.110
Now that damned voice will be silenced forever!

01:32:34.870 --> 01:32:37.910
Miserable, handsome witch, your race is finished!

01:32:38.130 --> 01:32:39.340
Shut up, Stephen! I can't!

01:32:45.960 --> 01:32:54.180
You'll sleep now, a long sleep that will be without any more dreams.

01:32:56.060 --> 01:32:57.120
Peace, Jenny.

01:33:05.980 --> 01:33:07.380
Come along now, lie down.

01:35:00.000 --> 01:35:01.900
It will still take a couple of hours.

01:35:02.000 --> 01:35:04.140
I'm going up to prepare everything for the journey.

01:35:04.280 --> 01:35:04.920
You stay still.

01:37:02.430 --> 01:37:03.290
Steven!

01:37:28.190 --> 01:37:28.930
Yes, Steven.

01:37:30.220 --> 01:37:31.900
It's my flesh you're touching.

01:37:33.060 --> 01:37:34.700
The flesh you thought you destroyed.

01:37:34.780 --> 01:37:41.050
But you can't destroy flesh any more than you can love or hate.

01:37:42.190 --> 01:37:43.850
It's all the same thing.

01:37:45.030 --> 01:37:45.910
What do you want?

01:37:47.580 --> 01:37:49.520
I punished you for your crime.

01:37:51.900 --> 01:37:56.480
No, you gave me extreme pleasure.

01:37:58.900 --> 01:37:59.960
You taught me...

01:38:00.510 --> 01:38:04.450
The pleasure of the torment of the flesh, which turns into ecstasy.

01:38:07.600 --> 01:38:12.640
Yes, Stephen, that passes through life into death and receives eternity.

01:38:13.710 --> 01:38:24.220
Now I'm going to reward you with that same pleasure, darling.

01:38:32.560 --> 01:38:32.980
Stephen?

01:38:37.820 --> 01:38:38.120
Stephen?

01:39:19.290 --> 01:39:29.980
Don't be afraid, Steven. I'll stay with you with my body and my senses until someone comes and destroys my heart.

01:40:00.410 --> 01:40:05.090
Now I've got your body and your monstrous soul if there is any such thing in your damn being.

01:40:06.700 --> 01:40:07.820
It's my moment now.

01:41:01.020 --> 01:41:07.150
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

01:43:37.610 --> 01:43:41.530
Don't worry, Jenny, now all of your nightmares are over and done with forever.
